{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["四輛馬車"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又舉目觀看，見有四輛馬車從兩座銅山之間出來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第一輛車套著紅馬，第二輛車套著黑馬，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第三輛車套著白馬，第四輛車套著斑點馬，馬都很雄壯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我問與我說話的天使：「主啊，這些馬車是作什麼的？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使說：「他們是侍立在天下之主面前的四靈",{"noteId":2},"，正在出發。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["套著黑馬的車前往北方，套著白馬的車前往西方",{"noteId":3},"，套著斑點馬的車前往南方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["這些雄壯的馬出來，迫不及待地要巡察大地。天使說：「你們去巡察大地吧！」牠們便遵命而行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他又高聲對我說：「看啊，那些到北方去的已在那裡使我的心得到安慰。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["為約書亞加冕"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「被擄到巴比倫的黑玳、多比雅和耶大雅已經回來了，你要收集他們奉獻的金銀，並在當天去西番雅的兒子約西亞家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你要用這些金銀製作冠冕，戴在約撒答的兒子約書亞大祭司頭上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["告訴他，萬軍之耶和華說，『看啊，那被稱為大衛苗裔的要從自己的地方興起，建造耶和華的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["祂必建造耶和華的殿，帶著威榮坐在寶座上掌權，也必有祭司坐在寶座上",{"noteId":4},"，兩者和諧共存。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["這冠冕要留在耶和華的殿中，作為對黑玳",{"noteId":5},"、多比雅、耶大雅和西番雅的兒子約西亞",{"noteId":6},"的紀念。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["遠方的人也要來建造耶和華的殿。那時你們便知道，是萬軍之耶和華差遣我到你們這裡來的。你們若全心遵從你們上帝耶和華的話，這事就必成就。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"「靈」或譯「風」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":5}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「前往西方」或譯「跟在後面」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":6}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"「也必有祭司坐在寶座上」或譯「也必坐在寶座上做祭司」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":13}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"「黑玳」希伯來文作「希連」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"「約西亞」希伯來文作「賢」，意思是「恩慈者」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}